## Assumptions
The team is assuming that RCHN clinic staff will set time aside to be available for training during their shift, if this is wrong then this might affect the go live of the project.

The team is assuming if the old data cannot be migrated accurately then the team will add data clean up to the scope and hold each clinic go live until its data which will add additional cost and resources


